--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
command: turn on lantern
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> turn on lantern
You switch the battery-powered brass lantern on. Your sword has begun to glow very brightly.

Cyclops Room
You are in a room with an exit on the west side, and a staircase leading up.

A cyclops, who looks prepared to eat horses (much less mere adventurers), blocks the staircase. From his state of health, and the bloodstains on the walls, you gather that he is not very friendly, though he likes people.

